# CopySpellAbilityEffect.java: Swarm Intelligence's Mode$ SpellCast trigger
# (OptionalDecider$ You) resolves DB$ CopySpellAbility | Defined$
# TriggeredSpellAbility | MayChooseTarget$ True. Human casts Lightning Bolt
# at ai and accepts the trigger; the copy goes on the stack above the
# resolving trigger, not cast (CR 707.10), and its controller chooses a new
# target for it (CR 707.10c): ai's Grizzly Bears. The copy resolves first
# and kills the Bears, then ceases to exist instead of reaching a graveyard
# (CR 707.10a); the original Bolt deals 3 to ai and goes to human's
# graveyard.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 R
queue targets ai
queue optionaltrigger true
queue confirmeffect true
queue targets 4
castspell human 1
resolvestack
